nal cough</37>, <38>loose stools</38>, <39>constipation</39>, <40>occasional headaches</40>. Constitutional: Negative for <41>fever</41>, <42>chills</42>, <43>diaphoresis</43>, <44>appetite change</44>, +<45>fatigue</45> and <46>unexpected weight change</46>. HENT: Negative for <47>hearing loss</47>,
