d sagittal <23>PET images</23> with and without attenuation correction was interpreted. Acquired and fused <24>PET/CT images</24> were reviewed alongside the <25>PET images</25>. Patient's random <26>blood glucose</26> at the time of <27>FDG injection</27> was <28>117 mg/dL</28>.
