ner_results: ```plaintext
Additional low-level <1>hypermetabolism</1> along the anterior <2>right breast tissue expander</2> is also favored to reflect <3>postprocedural changes</3>; correlate clinically for <4>superimposed infection</4>. Associated low-level <5>hypermetabolism</5> in <6>left greater than right axillary/subpectoral nodes</6> is nonspecific in the setting of <7>ongoing infection</7>. Incidental <8>right thyroid nodule</8> measuring up to <9>2.1 cm</9> with associated <10>FDG uptake</10>. Recommend further evaluation with dedicated <11>thyroid ultrasound</11>. Diffuse low-level <12>marrow hypermetabolism</12> is nonspecific; correlate with <13>lab values</13> for <14>anemia</14>. <15>tamoxifen</15> 02/06/21 start <16>zoladex</16> 02/13/21 Start <17>adjuvant taxol</17> weekly, <18>12 cycles</18> planned followed by <19>AC x 4 cycles</19> planned
