ood is pretty good. She thinks <32>anxiety</32> is slightly improved. When she cannot sleep due to anxiety, she takes half tab of <33>Klonopin</33>. She does not take it every night. ***** was prescribed previously but she never took it. She has as local ***** that she saw a few weeks ago.
