ner_results: ```plaintext
Recommend correlation with <1>urinalysis</1> and <2>symptoms</2>. 4. Postsurgical changes from <3>hysterectomy</3> and <4>bilateral salpingo-oophorectomy</4>. Associated <5>hypodensity</5> within the <6>right ovarian vein</6> favored to represent <7>thrombus</7> versus less likely mixing artifact. 01/07/21 <8>Renal/kidney u/s</8>: Normal size <9>bilateral kidneys</9>. No <10>hydronephrosis</10> or <11>renal calculus</11> noted. Of note, targeted <12>Doppler interrogation</12> demonstrates region with relative decreased vascularity at the <13>left lower pole</13>, corresponding to the site of ***** on ***** ***** scan. Adjacent to this, a small round focus with abnormal turbulent pulsatile flow is demonstrated. 01/08/21 <14>CT angiogram abdomen</14>: <15>Left inferior renal artery vascular irregularity</15> with associated <16>inferior pole hypoperfusion</16>, likely representing partially thrombosed <17>dissection</17> with <18>aneurysm</18> versus <19>pseudoaneurysm</19> measuring up to 0.6 cm, not definitively seen on 10/11/2020 examination. <20>Left hepatic lobe irregular 1.5 cm hypodensity</20>, incompletely characterized. <21>Right middle lobe peripheral 0.4 cm lesion</21>, increased in prominence compared to 11/11/2020. <22>Total abdominal hysterectomy/bilateral salpingo-oophorectomy postsurgical changes</22> with associated <23>distal right ovarian vein thrombosis</23>. Prominent but not pathologically enlarged <24>periaortic lymph nodes</24>. 01/09/21 <25>Endobronchial biopsy</25>: <26>Benign bronchial tissue</26>. <27>FNA</27>: A. <28>Lymph node, station 11R</28>, <29>endobronchial ultrasound-guided fine needle aspiration biopsy</29>: <30>Non-necrotizing granulomatous inflammation</30>; see comment: B. <31>Lymph node, station 7</31>, <32>endobronchial ultrasound-guided fine needle aspiration biopsy</32>: <33>Non-necrotizing granulomatous inflammation</33>; see comment: C. <34>Lymph node, station 11L</34>, <35>endobronchial ultrasound-guided fine needle aspiration biopsy</35>: <36>Non-necrotizing granulomatous inflammation</36>; see comment: 01/09/21 <37>Invitae genetic testing</37>: <38>Pathogenic variant</38> in *****. <39>Variant of uncertain significance</39> in
``` 
