<34>intermediate nuclear grade</34>; see  comment.  2. <35>Biopsy site changes</35> and <36>necrosis</36>.  3. <37>Microcalcifications</37> with stroma and as detached fragments.       COMMENT:  The biopsy consists mostly of <38>granulation tissue</38>, <39>foamy</39>
