igraphic evidence of osseous metastases.  -02/07/20: <29>C2 TC</29>  -02/28/20: <30>C3 Abraxane and Cyclophosphamide</30> (<31>Taxotere</31> dc'd due to <32>eye toxicity</32>)   -03/14/20: <33>Breast MRI</33>: RIGHT
