can also be associated with <1>flu-like symptoms</1> typically with the first infusion. In addition, we discussed the emerging role of <2>inhibitor therapy</2> in the treatment of <3>ER positive breast cancer</3>. The addition of <4>inhibitors</4> is associated with significant <5>DFS</5> and <6>survival benefit</6> in patients with <7>metastatic breast cancer</7> (***** ***** *****; ***** ***** *****). Phase 3 studies in <8>early stage breast cancer</8> have been completed but the outcomes data are not yet available. Press releases from ***** and ***** ***** have reported mixed results for adjuvant <9>palbociclib</9> and <10>abemaciclib</10>. This may be due to differences in risk categories accrued or may be due to differences in the agents or other study designs and can only be intelligently evaluated when the data is presented or published. The <11>ribociclib phase 3 study</11> is open at ***** (*****) and this remains an option should it still be open to accrual when ***** reaches her <12>hormone therapy period</12>. Alternatively <13>inhibitors</13> may be used off label in this high risk case with her knowledge and consent. ***** will benefit from <14>post-operative radiotherapy</14> whether she ***** <15>breast-conserving surgery</15> or <16>mastectomy</16>. The high risk nature of her disease including the extensive <17>LN involvement</17> portend a high risk of local relapse and mortality that can be reduced by <18>RT</18> even in the post-mastectomy setting (***** ***** *****). In addition to the treatment of the breast or chest wall and regional <19>LNs</19>, ***** may chose to treat the semi-suspicious left lateral rib lesion with <20>stereotactic RT</20>. Indeed the management of <21>oligometastatic breast cancer</21> with <22>stereotactic radiation approaches</22> can result in considerable durations of disease control and survival, ***** when the oligometastatic site is in <23>bone</23> (***** ***** *****)(***** ***** *****)(***** ***** *****)(***** Int J Radiat ***** Biol Phys 2019; 104:1194). ***** will be continuing her
