baseline <32>joint pain</32> due to her <33>fibromyalgia</33>, so we will monitor this closely. She is already on <34>duloxetine</34> which has been shown to help, and is on <35>celebrex</35> as well. We recommend <36>NSAIDs</36> for <37>joint pain</37>.
``` 
