2>. <53>1.7 cm suspicious lesion</53> in segment 7. <54>9mm low attenuation lesion</54> within <55>pancreatic uncinate</55> is nonspecific. 08/13/17 <56>bone scan</56> - no osseous metastatic disease 08/21/17 <57>left breast re-excision of margins</57> - no tumor seen 09/02/17 <58>PET CT (non-con)</58> - <59>hypermetabolic 2.6 cm segment 7 hepatic hypodensity</59> suspicious for <60>metastasis</60>. Additional <61>1.6 x 2.0 cm hypermetabolic soft tissue</61>
