g compression fracture of L2</47>, without significant retropulsion at this time.  03/11/20: <48>CT CAP</48>: <49>Enlarged right axillary and mediastinal lymphadenopathy</49> suspicious for <50>metastatic disease</50> although, the <51>lymph nodes</51> appear to be slightly decreased in size from the prior exam. <52>Diffuse osseous metastatic disease</52> unchanged from the prior exam07/01/20: <53>CT CAP</53>: <54>Pathologic right axillary mediastinal</54>
