inue <41>xeloda</41> for now and monitor with follow up visit in 3-4 weeks and then repeat <42>MRI brain</42> in late November."  11/07/20: <43>ED presentation</43> for <44>dizziness</44>. <45>NCHCT</45>: ***** thickening bilaterally demonstrating a somewhat nodular appearance concerning for <46>dural metastases</46>, more prominent than prior <47>CT</47>. No <48>mass</48>
